From: bubbapang <adamtpangelinan@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 18:24:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] i18n(ru): translate the last empty executive-surface string
 (P0-8)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

'SLA breached' -> 'Нарушение SLA' on FrontDoorSection and telegram-inbox.
Closes the final open item of P0-8: empty msgstr in the executive region
went 53 (at register commit 03ef9825f) to 0 with this change.
---
 apps/admin/messages/ru.po | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/admin/messages/ru.po b/apps/admin/messages/ru.po
index 07e37832d..7d58aa08b 100644
--- a/apps/admin/messages/ru.po
+++ b/apps/admin/messages/ru.po
@@ -20987,7 +20987,7 @@ msgstr ""
 #: app/[locale]/(dashboard)/crm/_components/telegram-inbox.tsx:91
 #: app/[locale]/(dashboard)/dashboards/executive/_components/FrontDoorSection.tsx:77
 msgid "RY1JgY"
-msgstr ""
+msgstr "Нарушение SLA"
 
 #: app/[locale]/(dashboard)/crm/_components/telegram-inbox.tsx:102
 msgid "0ZonMM"
-- 
